WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,610
We are now the third son of the Lu family

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,610
Lu Chenxi's helper

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:07,010
As long as we help him win over the family's broken love

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:10,010
He will tell us who the enemy is

5
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,900
and help us take revenge

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,600
You are still helping the world

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,020
The subordinate Jingyunzhen who can train like this

8
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:26,950
At least it’s the final product

9
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,350
Lu Chenxi is lying

10
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,750
He doesn't know at all

11
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,830
who is your enemy

12
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,090
This is the direct son of the Lu family

13
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:36,610
There are many secrets in this world

14
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:38,400
You can't hide it from him

15
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,270
if he knows the truth

16
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,870
I will tell you directly who the enemy is

17
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:46,100
Because all I need to hear is my wife’s background

18
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,700
You will give up your heart and surrender.

19
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,100
Work hard for him

20
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:56,460
You'd better not pull this trick in front of me

21
00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:00,820
This alone makes us work hard to dream for the Lu family.

22
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,620
People who took advantage of us back then
